    {
      "unit_id": "315e1446b4fabf965faf8268f197391697ec92fc9e799ed7e6fe87e7b49909f2",
      "unit_type": "prose",
      "text": "THE STONE COLOSSUS LOOMS AS A SLOW-MOVING JUGGERNAUT OF FUSED BOULDERS AND GLOWING MOLTEN SEAMS, ITS STEPS SENDING TREMORS THROUGH EARTH AND BONE ALIKE. A LIVING MONUMENT TO RAW FORCE, IT CRUSHES BARRIERS AND COMPETITORS WITH UNWAVERING RESOLVE, SHAPING THE BATTLEFIELD WITH WALL-RAISING POWER AND SHATTERING THE GROUND BENEATH ITS FOES. THE MERE ACT OF ITS ADVANCE IS AN EVENT—INEVITABLE, IMPLACABLE, AND THRILLING TO BEHOLD IN THE ARENA'S THUNDEROUS ATMOSPHERE.\nArmor Class : 12\nHit Points: 38 Hit Dice : 7d10+7\nSpeed: walk : 30",
